OL,3,GNEWSANew plea to restore Grade II
OL,4,Alisted staiths
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new campaign to kickstart major
OL,7,Frepairs to a Grade II structure on the
OL,8,FRiver Tyne has been launched.
OL,10,FDunston Staiths, in Gateshead, is in
OL,11,Fneed of significant maintenance to
OL,12,Fcombat age-related wear as well as
OL,13,Fdamage from arson attacks.
OL,15,FAs local preservation teams pursue a
OL,16,Fmulti-million pound cash injection for
OL,17,Fthe landmark, a fundraising effort has
OL,18,Fbeen set up to begin the first stage of
OL,19,Fessential repairs required to keep
OL,20,FDunston Staiths open to the public.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
